1
00:00:24,879 --> 00:00:26,640
My father is an airline captain.

2
00:00:26,879 --> 00:00:28,719
My mother is a full-time homemaker.

3
00:00:29,039 --> 00:00:30,960
Because of my father's job transfers,

4
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,799
my mother and I followed him

5
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:34,079
and moved around a lot since I was young.

6
00:00:34,359 --> 00:00:36,600
We just moved here a week ago.

7
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,439
I majored in psychology in college.

8
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,679
As teenagers grow up,

9
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:44,119
the environments they're in and the people they interact with

10
00:00:44,119 --> 00:00:45,640
can cause negative impacts.

11
00:00:45,759 --> 00:00:47,920
I believe these can be corrected through psychological counseling

12
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,159
and educational interventions.

13
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,479
Just like young saplings,

14
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:54,000
they need careful nurturing,

15
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:57,079
but the key is pruning.

16
00:00:58,159 --> 00:01:00,240
Only then can they grow up strong.

17
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:02,240
Oh, right.

18
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:03,640
I forgot to mention.

19
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:04,879
My name is Yang Lin.

20
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,040
Qianqian, need any help?

21
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,480
No need.

22
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:58,959
That must be Wenhao and the others.

23
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:00,280
I'll go get the door.

24
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:04,959
Be careful in there.

25
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,680
Lao Gao, Xu Hui, you're here.

26
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:14,199
I brought our little Alice

27
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,000
to Wonderland.

28
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,280
And you brought a gift?

29
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:20,560
Can't show up empty-handed.

30
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,199
Domaine Leroy, 2000.

31
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:24,919
This must be worth a fortune.

32
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:28,039
Brought you a diffuser to clear the air.

33
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:29,879
New houses have too much formaldehyde.

34
00:02:31,039 --> 00:02:32,360
Your eyeliner looks a bit smudged.

35
00:02:33,439 --> 00:02:34,039
Does it?

36
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:36,039
Yes. Go check in the mirror.

37
00:02:36,039 --> 00:02:36,840
Where's Luo Qian?

38
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,080
Busy in the kitchen.

39
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,840
Qianqian!

40
00:02:46,319 --> 00:02:48,199
This balcony is nice.

41
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:49,319
Lao Zhou!

42
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,400
There's even a lake.

43
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:52,759
And swans!

44
00:02:53,319 --> 00:02:54,199
Swans?

45
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,319
Swans!

46
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:01,680
Stop laughing. What are you filming?

47
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,159
Filming you. I'll go decant the wine.

48
00:03:04,479 --> 00:03:06,360
Qianqian.

49
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:08,000
Look at you.

50
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:10,479
Do I look good? Check out my new clothes.

51
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,319
You look great. So pretty.

52
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,360
What would you like to drink?

53
00:03:12,439 --> 00:03:13,240
Anything is fine.

54
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,800
I saw that. Who is it?

55
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:23,479
I'll go decant the wine.

56
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:25,599
Lao Zhou!

57
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:27,759
Sorry, sorry! I'm late.

58
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:28,599
It's fine, no worries.

59
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:29,159
Lao Gao.

60
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:30,919
Brought you a bottle of wine.

61
00:03:31,039 --> 00:03:31,919
You shouldn't have.

62
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:33,000
It's the least I could do.

63
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:35,039
Your place is really nice.

64
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:36,039
Liu Yang.

65
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,520
Oh, you don't need to take your shoes off.

66
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:38,960
Really?

67
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,520
Really. We don't take our shoes off here.

68
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:41,840
Okay.

69
00:03:48,759 --> 00:03:49,919
Could you close the door for me?

70
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,719
Will do.

71
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:52,800
Lao Gao.

72
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,120
I want to talk to you about an investment.

73
00:03:55,159 --> 00:03:55,840
Got a minute?

74
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:56,719
Let's go.

75
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:57,319
Let's go.

76
00:03:57,319 --> 00:03:57,719
Let's go.

77
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,080
Then I'll decant the wine first.

78
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,560
This wine must be quite expensive.

79
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:17,920
Not too bad.

80
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,199
Probably under 100,000.

81
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:24,199
Do you want to decant your bottle too?

82
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:27,279
No need. This bottle of mine

83
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,360
has never even gone to sleep.

84
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,560
I've looked into it.

85
00:04:34,959 --> 00:04:37,199
The pharmaceutical company has a clear equity structure.

86
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,600
And this kind of anti-aging drug

87
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,920
is a future necessity.

88
00:04:42,079 --> 00:04:43,639
But I know absolutely nothing about pharmaceuticals.

89
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,120
Don't worry. I've got you covered.

90
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:46,240
What are you chatting about?

91
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:51,120
Investments. Like you'd understand.

92
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,759
You and Lao Zhou are so kind,

93
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,720
willing to include him.

94
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,800
Why do I remember in high school,

95
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,199
you were the one who brought him in?

96
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:05,000
He's useful.

97
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,079
You and Lao Zhou seem to be doing great.

98
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:18,560
He's having an affair.

99
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:20,879
Probably.

100
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,120
You're pretty calm about it.

101
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:24,439
I don't care.

102
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,879
As long as he doesn't bring trouble home.

103
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,079
Needs a bit more time.

104
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,959
I gotta say,

105
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:20,959
the wine Liu Yang brought...

106
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:22,720
It tastes a bit rough,

107
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:24,199
but it's got a kick.

108
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,040
I've always said,

109
00:06:27,319 --> 00:06:28,879
expensive wine isn't always better.

110
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,560
Are you free next Sunday?

111
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,600
Yeah.

112
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:35,040
Let's get together.

113
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:36,519
We should take the kids camping.

114
00:06:36,639 --> 00:06:37,040
Sounds good.

115
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:37,560
Sure.

116
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,319
Where's Xiao Yu?

117
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:40,279
It's so late, and he's not back yet.

118
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,680
He went to summer camp.

119
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:44,040
What about Xiao Chen?

120
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,639
Why do you always worry about other people's kids?

121
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,839
What do you mean "other people's kids"?

122
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,439
I watched them grow up too.

123
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:52,759
They're no different from my own.

124
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,319
Right, Lao Gao?

125
00:06:58,439 --> 00:07:00,040
Xiao Chen also went to summer camp.

126
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:03,879
Are there other guests?

127
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,240
No.

128
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:06,279
I'll get it.

129
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:09,439
I'll get it, I got it.

130
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,319
Did any of you buy a cake?

131
00:07:25,079 --> 00:07:25,839
A cake?

132
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,040
Whose birthday is it?

133
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:34,839
"To the one I miss the most."

134
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:44,199
Gao Wenhao.

135
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:45,920
Did you buy the cake?

136
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:47,519
No, I didn't.

137
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:49,399
Xu Hui, did you buy it?

138
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:52,560
Liu Yang.

139
00:07:58,839 --> 00:07:59,920
Did you buy the cake?

140
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,839
Why would I buy a cake when it's nobody's birthday?

141
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:06,439
Then who sent it?

142
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:08,680
It must be someone you know.

143
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,800
Otherwise, how would they know your address?

144
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,800
If someone sent me a cake,

145
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,800
wouldn't I know?

146
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:15,680
Zhou Minglei.

147
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,560
Haven't I told you?

148
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,279
Don't bring your mess home.

149
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:21,839
What do you mean?

150
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,759
Zhou Minglei.

151
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:25,639
Even the hospital you work at is owned by my family.

152
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:28,639
I know exactly which nurses you're fooling around with.

153
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,600
Qianqian, what nonsense are you saying?

154
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,559
Do you want me to bring out the proof?

155
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:48,440
Luo Qian.

156
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:51,200
Even if there really is a problem between us,

157
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,960
does it have to be today?

158
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:54,679
Then what do you want me to do?

159
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:56,960
Eat the cake with a smile on my face?

160
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:01,679
There's an envelope here too.

161
00:09:03,559 --> 00:09:04,399
Let me see.

162
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:05,919
Let me see. Let me see it.

163
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:06,679
Give it to me.

164
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,200
Why are you acting so guilty?

165
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:11,279
Why would I feel guilty? That's ridiculous.

166
00:09:11,879 --> 00:09:12,559
Who is it?

167
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:16,919
Take a look.

168
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,080
Sure.

169
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:19,480
Look.

170
00:09:19,519 --> 00:09:20,519
Crisis averted.

171
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:26,279
The cake was sent by the school.

172
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:29,799
Come on, let's have a drink.

173
00:09:30,799 --> 00:09:33,080
This cake from the school is just too creepy.

174
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,200
The summer camp teacher is calling me.

175
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,200
Hello, Ms. Yang?

176
00:09:46,799 --> 00:09:49,720
It shows here that the cake was signed for.

177
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,360
You bought the cake?

178
00:09:52,759 --> 00:09:54,279
How is it? Is it good?

179
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,799
We haven't eaten it yet.

180
00:09:57,399 --> 00:10:00,960
That's fine. Take your time to enjoy it.

181
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:04,120
Xiao Chen and Xiao Yu are with me too.

182
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,480
They're having a great time.

183
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:08,320
Great, thank you.

184
00:10:08,879 --> 00:10:10,480
Can I talk to Xiao Yu for a moment?

185
00:10:10,799 --> 00:10:11,919
I'm afraid not.

186
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,519
Why?

187
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,200
Because between us,

188
00:10:16,679 --> 00:10:18,720
there are still some unresolved issues.

189
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:21,679
What issues do we have?

190
00:10:22,639 --> 00:10:23,480
That can only be

191
00:10:24,679 --> 00:10:25,679
discussed in person.

192
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,159
I'll send the address to you shortly.

193
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:30,720
Us?

194
00:10:31,559 --> 00:10:33,559
Yes, all of you.

195
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,039
Zhou Minglei,

196
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:42,759
Gao Wenhao,

197
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:47,600
Xu Hui,

198
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:51,720
Liu Yang,

199
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:55,720
you,

200
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:58,200
all of you.

201
00:10:59,879 --> 00:11:01,159
Not a single one of you can be missing.

202
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:05,399
Ms. Yang, how did you know we were together?

203
00:11:05,639 --> 00:11:07,080
Did Xiao Yu tell you?

204
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:10,240
Ms. Yang, I'm Xiao Yu's father.

205
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,159
Please don't joke around.

206
00:11:12,919 --> 00:11:14,799
Where is Xiao Yu right now?

207
00:11:18,399 --> 00:11:19,519
Joke around?

208
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:22,679
Isn't your favorite thing to do

209
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,720
joking around?

210
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:29,519
We haven't seen each other in a long time.

211
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,240
Shouldn't we have some real fun?

212
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,320
I'll be waiting.

213
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:38,080
Ms. Yang! Ms. Yang!

214
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:41,840
Who is this teacher?

215
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:44,200
I don't know. She just added me on WeChat this morning.

216
00:11:44,639 --> 00:11:46,559
How does she know my name and Liu Yang's?

217
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:53,759
Lin Yajing.

218
00:11:56,039 --> 00:11:56,600
Who?

219
00:11:58,679 --> 00:11:59,320
I said,

220
00:12:00,519 --> 00:12:02,279
the woman in this photo is Lin Yajing.

221
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:04,679
It's only half a face.

222
00:12:06,039 --> 00:12:07,120
It's probably the one from the summer camp,

223
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,320
that Yang Lin.

224
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,679
It is Lin Yajing.

225
00:12:10,799 --> 00:12:11,799
I wouldn't mistake her for anyone else.

226
00:12:12,559 --> 00:12:13,559
Are you sure it's her?

227
00:12:13,799 --> 00:12:16,919
The color and position of this mole are exactly the same.

228
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:17,720
Keep running!

229
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,759
Don't run away!

230
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,279
Run, come on!

231
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,600
Give her the book back.

232
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,000
Here, alright, pick it up.

233
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:36,080
Let's see what a top student's book looks like.

234
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,120
What is this?

235
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,399
Read it to me, will you?

236
00:12:39,639 --> 00:12:40,679
What does this mean?

237
00:12:41,279 --> 00:12:42,600
Stand up.

238
00:12:42,639 --> 00:12:44,200
Did I tell you to squat?

239
00:12:44,519 --> 00:12:45,960
Then do a dance, okay?

240
00:12:48,679 --> 00:12:50,120
Smile. Give us a smile.

241
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,600
Smile. That's right.

242
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,120
Five, six, seven, turn!

243
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,919
Two, two, three, four!

244
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,360
Five, six, seven, turn!

245
00:12:56,360 --> 00:13:00,279
Let me help you. Come on, spin, spin!

246
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,240
Since she can talk,

247
00:13:06,919 --> 00:13:08,399
let's have her sing a song.

248
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:12,759
Happy birthday to you...

249
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,440
Happy birthday...

250
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,759
You're wishing me a happy birthday?

251
00:13:15,759 --> 00:13:17,200
What are you crying for?

252
00:13:17,919 --> 00:13:18,919
Sing with a smile.

253
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:22,559
Happy birthday to you...

254
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:26,840
Happy birthday to you...

255
00:13:27,559 --> 00:13:31,080
Happy birthday to you...

256
00:13:35,879 --> 00:13:37,159
Haven't you met that Yang Lin?

257
00:13:37,159 --> 00:13:37,960
Didn't I tell you?

258
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,360
I only added her on WeChat this morning.

259
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,039
Hello, Mr. Gao.

260
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:43,919
Principal!

261
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,159
Xiao Chen and Xiao Yu...

262
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:46,480
attending the summer camp...

263
00:13:46,519 --> 00:13:47,200
you know about this, right?

264
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,360
Of course I do.

265
00:13:48,519 --> 00:13:50,159
The person in charge is a teacher named Yang Lin.

266
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,080
Do you know her?

267
00:13:51,639 --> 00:13:52,360
Right, right.

268
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:54,159
Well, she...

269
00:13:54,159 --> 00:13:55,799
isn't a teacher at our school.

270
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,559
She's the camp director.

271
00:13:57,799 --> 00:13:59,039
Then how much do you know about her?

272
00:14:01,039 --> 00:14:02,120
Why are you asking?

273
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,240
Just answer me first.

274
00:14:05,639 --> 00:14:07,240
I wouldn't say I know her well.

275
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:08,759
The person who actually communicated with her

276
00:14:08,799 --> 00:14:10,919
was another teacher from our school.

277
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:13,600
Then can you contact the camp?

278
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,720
We have an emergency.

279
00:14:14,759 --> 00:14:16,120
We need to bring Xiao Chen and Xiao Yu home.

280
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,679
That shouldn't be a problem.

281
00:14:18,919 --> 00:14:20,559
Okay, get back to me immediately when you do.

282
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:21,960
Okay, got it.

283
00:14:23,919 --> 00:14:25,120
This Yang Lin is definitely suspicious.

284
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:26,360
What do we do now?

285
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,960
She wouldn't hurt the kids...

286
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:30,440
Call the police.

287
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,399
What are you doing?

288
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,960
The kids are still in her hands!

289
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:33,759
Then what should we do?

290
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,519
Do nothing?

291
00:14:35,559 --> 00:14:36,600
Just sit here and wait?

292
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:38,840
Luo Qian is right.

293
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,399
If it really is Lin Yajing,

294
00:14:41,159 --> 00:14:42,480
she must have come prepared.

295
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,600
Then what do you think she actually wants?

296
00:14:45,559 --> 00:14:46,440
Isn't it obvious?

297
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,480
She definitely wants revenge on us.

298
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,320
Didn't she just say she wanted to meet us?

299
00:15:06,879 --> 00:15:08,080
I'm already here.

300
00:15:08,679 --> 00:15:10,200
You can come over anytime.

301
00:15:14,159 --> 00:15:14,919
Principal.

302
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:15,919
We just...

303
00:15:15,919 --> 00:15:16,960
contacted the camp.

304
00:15:17,279 --> 00:15:18,159
They said Ms. Yang

305
00:15:18,159 --> 00:15:19,879
left with Xiao Chen and Xiao Yu.

306
00:15:20,159 --> 00:15:20,960
Where did they go?

307
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,600
We're not sure yet.

308
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,759
And we can't reach Ms. Yang at the moment.

309
00:15:29,759 --> 00:15:30,559
What do we do?

310
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:35,879
Doesn't she want to settle this?

311
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,120
Fine.

312
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,480
Let's give her that chance.

313
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,120
Looks like we're on our own this time.

314
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,919
Xiao Hu, stay here on standby.

315
00:16:08,039 --> 00:16:08,559
Got it.

316
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,799
Are we going the right way?

317
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,080
Yes, yes.

318
00:16:46,799 --> 00:16:47,840
Looks like this is the place.

319
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:50,039
You go look.

320
00:16:51,799 --> 00:16:52,919
I'll check over there. Let's head down first.

321
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:54,440
Xiao Chen!

322
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,039
Xiao Yu!

323
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,159
Xiao Yu!

324
00:16:56,399 --> 00:16:57,159
Xiao Yu!

325
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:57,960
Xiao Chen!

326
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:00,120
Xiao Yu!

327
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,200
Xiao Chen!

328
00:17:02,919 --> 00:17:03,759
Xiao Yu!

329
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,680
Xiao Yu! Xiao Chen!

330
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:06,519
Xiao Chen!

331
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:07,920
Xiao Chen!

332
00:17:10,559 --> 00:17:11,519
Slow down, Liu Yang.

333
00:17:11,759 --> 00:17:12,640
Put me down first.

334
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:13,200
Hurry!

335
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:14,920
Xiao Chen!

336
00:17:15,559 --> 00:17:17,839
Xiao Yu! Xiao Chen! Xiao Yu!

337
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,440
Xiao Chen!

338
00:17:19,559 --> 00:17:20,519
Xiao Yu!

339
00:17:22,559 --> 00:17:23,200
Xiao Chen!

340
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,000
Xiao Yu!

341
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:28,880
Xiao Chen!

342
00:17:31,559 --> 00:17:32,559
Xiao Yu!

343
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,599
Is it here?

344
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:35,440
Be quiet.

345
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:38,680
A mysterious place,

346
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:45,519
Where children's dreams are kept.

347
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:53,039
Colorful lights and merry-go-rounds in a bustling blur.

348
00:17:53,720 --> 00:18:00,599
There are screams, laughter, and a little sorrow.

349
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:07,559
We share the same sunlight.

350
00:18:12,039 --> 00:18:13,240
Old classmates,

351
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:18,039
Do you still remember me?

352
00:18:21,119 --> 00:18:25,000
Welcome to our reunion.

353
00:18:26,279 --> 00:18:27,880
Long time no see.
